<p>The Indian Builders Association (IBA) negotiates special rates for members. Ask your mover whether they are <strong>IBA approved</strong> and request the associated discount sheet. Often, you’ll receive a flat 5‑10 % reduction on the quoted price, plus priority loading during peak seasons.</p>

