<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Local vs Intercity Shifting Rates in Ranchi | 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors cause the price gap between local and intercity shifting charges in Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price gap stems from distance‑based fuel surcharges, toll taxes, interstate permits, longer labor hours, and higher insurance premiums for longer hauls. Local moves benefit from shorter travel, lower fuel multipliers, and minimal regulatory fees, while intercity moves must account for all these additional cost layers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I obtain a transparent quote for both local and intercity moves from Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Request a detailed quotation from IBA approved packers and movers like Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers. Provide exact inventory, weight, and destination details. The quote should itemize base fare, per‑kilometer charge, packaging, insurance, tolls, and any extra services, ensuring full transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is it cheaper to use shared containers for intercity shifting from Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, shared container services can lower the per‑kilogram cost because you share truck space and fuel expenses with other customers. However, ensure the mover follows the 7‑layer packaging protocol and provides IRDAI‑approved insurance to protect your goods during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do local moves in Ranchi require any special permits or documentation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Local moves within Ranchi typically do not need interstate permits or e‑Way bills, but you must still provide a GST‑compliant invoice and a signed packing list. Reliable movers will also give a GST‑registered bill that can be used for corporate reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included in the shifting charges for intercity moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance as part of the intercity shifting package. This covers loss, theft, or damage during the entire journey, and the premium is calculated based on the total declared value of your household goods.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
